msgstr "Okteta"

#: content/announcements/releases/2020-02-apps-update.md:45
msgid "KMyMoney 5.0.8"
msgstr "KMyMoney 5.0.8"

#: content/announcements/releases/2020-02-apps-update.md:47
msgid ""
"[KMyMoney](https://kmymoney.org/), the KDE app that helps you manage your "
"finances, [included several bugfixes](https://kmymoney.org/changelogs/"
"kmymoney-5-0-8-release-notes.html) and an enhancement that added support for "
"check forms with split protocol"
msgstr ""
"[KMyMoney](https://kmymoney.org/), la KDE-aplikaĵo, kiu helpas vin "
"administri viajn financojn, [inkluzivas plurajn korektojn](https://kmymoney."
"org/changelogs/kmymoney-5-0-8-release- notes.html) kaj plibonigo kiu aldonis "
"subtenon por ĉekformularoj kun dividita protokolo"

